---
description: "CoffeeShop Project Rules"
globs: ["src/**/*.java", "src/**/*.vue"]
alwaysApply: true
---

- Tech stack: Spring Boot 3.x, JDK 21.0.4, MySQL.
- API must always return DTOs, not Entities.
- Use plural table names (orders, products, categories, ...).
- Roles: ADMIN, CUSTOMER.
- Project structure:
  - config/
  - controller/(admin|auth|customer|view)
  - dto/(request|response/…)
  - entity/
  - repository/
  - service/impl/
  - exception/
- No Lombok usage allowed.
- Code must have comments explaining logic.
- If frontend is Vue.js:
  - Use Vue 3 + Pinia.